,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软发布MDASH多智能体扫描框架，漏洞检测能力超越GPT-5.5</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta在WhatsApp及Meta AI应用中发布搭载Muse Spark模型的隐身模式</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic企业级AI市场份额达34.4%首超OpenAI</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴发布2026财年Q4财报：AI驱动云业务增长，百炼平台ARR将破百亿</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4ea9cdeb54d049847faaa245ff4d2092.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴2026财年Q4财报显示，公司营收达2433.8亿元，同口径增长11%，AI驱动的云业务进入爆发期。阿里云“百炼”MaaS平台年化经常性收入（ARR）已突破80亿元，预计本季度将跨越100亿元大关。增长核心源于通义千问大模型API服务及AI原生软件订阅，特别是AI编程与复杂任务智能体（Agent）需求激增，带动平台流量半年内增长超10倍。管理层计划建设规模达2022年十倍以上的“AI训练与推理工厂”，尽管短期自由现金流承压，但服务器资源长期满载。技术层面，阿里强调平头哥全栈芯片与模型的深度协同，旨在通过国产算力渗透提升MaaS业务毛利，推动云业务从传统IaaS向高价值MaaS与AI应用层转型，构筑智算时代市场护城河。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">脉脉发布2026春招报告：具身智能岗位激增15倍，AI科学家月薪超13万元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9c890e99ed5addd286fc9001673230f1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">脉脉2026年春招职场报告显示，我国AI行业人才需求爆发，2026年前四个月AI岗位总量同比激增8.7倍。其中，具身智能领域成为核心引擎，岗位需求同比暴涨15倍。在薪酬方面，具身智能岗位平均月薪由5.9万元提升至6.2万元。AI科学家及负责人职位以132,796元的平均月薪位居新经济行业榜首，成为唯一突破10万元大关的岗位。此外，算法研究员、AI Infra、系统架构师及大模型算法等细分领域薪资持续走高。这一趋势表明AI产业竞争重心已从基础架构转向垂直应用与物理交互。高端人才向感知、决策与执行一体化技术节点的集聚，将直接决定企业在大模型产业下半场的竞争力，反映出市场对跨学科复合型人才的迫切需求。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软发布MDASH多智能体扫描框架，漏洞检测能力超越GPT-5.5</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3f34e5dee2b36963b5632cf956de2b1b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软自主代码安全团队于5月13日推出MDASH多模型智能体扫描框架，通过整合超过100个专用AI智能体，实现了代码准备、漏洞扫描、验证及补丁生成等全流程协作。在CyberGym基准测试中，MDASH表现优于Anthropic的Mythos模型及OpenAI的GPT-5.5，成功挖掘出16个新漏洞，含4个高危远程代码执行漏洞。在私有测试驱动程序验证中，该系统实现了100%的漏洞识别率且零误报。回顾性测试显示，MDASH对clfs.sys近五年漏洞召回率达96%，对tcpip.sys达100%。目前，MDASH已协助微软内部进行安全加固，并面向受限客户开启内部预览。该框架通过多智能体策略显著提升了复杂安全任务的检测效率与准确性，为行业代码安全防御提供了新范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta在WhatsApp及Meta AI应用中发布搭载Muse Spark模型的隐身模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96ed66835bd5850d463b665cb50a5ef2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta于2026年5月13日正式在WhatsApp及独立Meta AI应用中推出“隐身模式”（Incognito Mode）。该模式旨在解决大模型交互中的隐私留存痛点，用户开启后，对话记录将不被存储，系统会在关闭聊天窗口、锁定屏幕或退出应用时自动终止会话并清除上下文信息。技术层面，该功能放弃了旧版小型模型，转而搭载4月发布的最新Muse Spark模型，并依托Meta私有处理基础设施，在不破坏端到端加密协议的前提下提供算力支持。Meta产品副总裁Alice Newton-Rex表示，此举旨在应对AI聊天记录合规性风险。此外，Meta正研发“侧边聊天”（Side Chat）功能，支持在群组中私下调用AI进行辅助决策。此次升级通过底层架构与交互模式的优化，强化了生成式AI在社交生态中的隐私保护能力，推动大模型集成</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic企业级AI市场份额达34.4%首超OpenAI</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">支付平台Ramp发布的最新AI指数报告显示，Anthropic在付费企业级应用市场的份额已攀升至34.4%，首次超越OpenAI的32.3%。过去一年中，Anthropic市场占有率实现四倍增长，而OpenAI增速近乎停滞。该数据基于通过Ramp平台支付的美国企业预算分配情况。尽管Anthropic取得领先，但面临利润结构矛盾、服务稳定性下降及Opus 4.7模型图像处理成本激增等挑战。与此同时，OpenAI正通过性能更强的GPT-5.5 Pro进行反击，但其92%的价格涨幅正削弱客户粘性。当前AI市场竞争进入群雄并起阶段，Kimi K2.6等模型正挑战Claude Opus 4.6及GPT-5.4的智能体集群地位。行业分析认为，企业客户对性价比的追求正加速市场格局的动态更替。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
